  'Keep only 28″ – 31″. Kennebec, Sheepscot and Androscoggin rivers: closed Dec 1 – Jun 30 (catch and release with single-hook lures May 1 – Jun 30). Circle hooks with bait; no gaffing. No striped bass fishing more than 3 miles out.', 'https://www.maine.gov/dmr/sites/maine.gov.dmr/files/inline-files/2026_striped_bass_regs%20-%20ADA%20compliant.pdf', '2026-10-22', true),
